1er8|a|Opposing; fronting. ; Exposed; subject; open; liable. ; Easily discovered, seen, or understood; readily perceived by the eye or the intellect; plain; evident; apparent; as, an obvious meaning; an obvious remark.	j:mqf,71,3;1y5n,41,3;1pug,39,11;cny,36,5;1bb0,35,2;anh,34,3;2ac7,30,4;1xs2,26,7;1pu7,21,7;2abm,19,16;1n4t,18,5;23uu,18,6;14ec,11,6;23uw,11,5;3fx,5,10~2abm,19,16;1pug,39,11;3fx,5,10;1pu7,21,7;1xs2,26,7;23uu,18,6;14ec,11,6;1n4o,2,5;cny,36,5;23uw,11,5;1n4t,18,5;b92,5,4;2ac7,30,4;mqf,71,3;anh,34,3	e:898,76,5;rk0,47,10;1mvc,40,19;10oi,35,3;p8t,31,3;16ui,29,14;6wi,28,2;elf,27,5;297h,15,15;1c22,11,20;24mq,9,7;1psw,6,5~1c22,11,20;1mvc,40,19;297h,15,15;16ui,29,14;rk0,47,10;24mq,9,7;898,76,5;1psw,6,5;elf,27,5;10oi,35,3;p8t,31,3;6wi,28,2
